# gate-adjudication reads the validator under test, the verdict schema, the enforcement map and
# the three sibling validators it shells to, plus the two step files the script-arms-first arm
# audits. seed.sh copies the validator and map into the seeded tree. Its own directory is
# copied by the runner without being named.
!core/scripts/validate-gate-adjudication.sh
core/scripts/validate-adversarial-convergence.sh
core/scripts/validate-steering-budget.sh
core/scripts/validate-suppression-lifetime.sh
core/schemas/gate-adjudication-verdict.json
core/skills/ai-dlc/enforcement-map.yaml
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/_gate-procedures.md
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/gate-validation.md
